      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_10ffe06c",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: i_bit_a_muslim; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts two men in a close, affectionate pose against a red background, with overlaid text that reads: 'i bit a muslim' and 'i had to lick my ass for an hour to get rid of the taste.' The visual of the two men is juxtaposed with the text to create a crude, degrading joke about Muslims, implying they have an unpleasant taste or smell. This is a direct attack on a religious group, using a disgusting and offensive metaphor to mock their identity. The intent is to spread Islamophobic stereotypes by associating Muslims with bodily disgust, which is a hateful and harmful message targeting a specific religious community.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_380ae013"
