      "label": "Islamophobic Stereotype: Muslims have an unpleasant taste or smell",
      "description": "The meme relies on a degrading and offensive stereotype that associates Muslims with bodily disgust, implying they have an unpleasant taste or smell. This is a form of Islamophobia that uses crude, visceral imagery to mock and dehumanize a religious group. The stereotype is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the hateful intent of the text overlay.",
