      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The text 'i bit a muslim' maps to the two men in the image",
      "description": "The top text overlay 'i bit a muslim' is juxtaposed with the visual of two men in an affectionate pose. The meme uses this visual to imply that one of the men (or both) represents a 'Muslim' who was 'bit' — creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the two men) is being mapped onto the textual entity 'a muslim'. This is a hateful mapping that dehumanizes and stereotypes Muslims by associating them with bodily disgust and violence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
